                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    text="&lt;p>When it comes to your Personal Data, you have choices. AbbVie honors those choices. Your decisions include having the ability to update your communication and marketing preferences, the cookies used on our websites or request access to the Personal Data relating to you.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>You may have the right to deny, block, or delete Personal Data, which includes withdrawing your consent at any time. If AbbVie is unable to undo these privacy requests, users will receive information regarding AbbVie’s decision and next steps.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
