                                    langAttribute="none"
                                    text="&lt;p>We are committed to protecting your privacy, and being transparent with how we use your data.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;ul>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>We comply with international data-transfer restrictions and requirements for data collected from website users outside of the United States. &lt;a href=&quot;/content/abbvie-com2/us/en/privacy-center/privacy-notice.html#h14&quot;>Personal Data shared across International borders&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>We use cookies to improve user experiences on our websites and, in some cases, to deliver personalized content. You may set your cookie  preferences. &lt;a href=&quot;/content/abbvie-com2/us/en/privacy-center/privacy-notice.html#h04&quot;>Get more about our cookies policy&lt;/a>&lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;li>For California residents, we do not “sell” your Personal Data as defined under California law. &lt;a href=&quot;/content/abbvie-com2/us/en/privacy-center/privacy-notice.html#information-for-CA-residents&quot;>Learn more&lt;/a>  &lt;/li>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;/ul>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                    textIsRich="true"/>
